  "description": "T1: London Plane: Rear 9 Canal Grove. 12m High. Lateral reduction by up to 3m. No reduction in height. Works to reduce water consumption needs and to manage drought symptoms.\rT2 to (excl T5) T14: London Plane: 20m High with 8m lateral radius. Height reduction by 5m, Lateral reduction by 5m. Removal of Massaria infected limbs. Works to reduce water consumption needs and to manage drought symptoms.\rT5: Lime: 19m H. 5.5m lateral radius. Height reduction by 4m, Lateral reduction by 2m. Lift to 2.4m. No thin as provides screening to adjacent development.\rTrees maintained at those dimensions every 2-3 years, for a period not exceeding 6 years (after which a new application should be made).\r",
